{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32920","headline":"伤贾岛无可 · 李郢","name":"伤贾岛无可","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"却到京师事事伤，惠休归寂贾生亡。\n何人收得文章箧，独我来经苔藓房。\n一命未沾爲逐客，万缘初尽别空王。\n萧萧竹坞斜阳在，叶覆闲堦雪拥墙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李郢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32920.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32920","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}